rday Night Live Fill-in","body":"Elvis Costello and the Attractions filled in for The Sex Pistols on \"Saturday Night Live\" when the latter's US tour visas were delayed, preventing them from appearing as scheduled. \"Their slot instead was filled by Elvis Costello in the attractions.\"","year":null,"extra":null,"srcs":[{"source":"The Ongoing History of New Music","episode":"Introducing \"Uncharted\": Sid Vicious and Questions About the Murder of Nancy Spungen","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=LE4YenwmeXM"}]}],"awards":[{"kind":"award","title":"Rock and Roll Hall of Fame (2003)","body":"Won.","year":2003,"extra":null,"srcs":[{"source":"Wikidata","episode":null,"url":"https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q179191"}]}],"concerts":[{"kind":"concert","title":"Saturday Night Live","body":null,"year":null,"extra":null,"srcs":[]}],"xref":[{"kind":"xref","title":"Saturday Night Live Cancellation","body":"As a direct result of their visa delays, the Sex Pistols were unable to appear on \"Saturday Night Live\" as scheduled. Their slot was instead filled by Elvis Costello and the Attractions. \"As a result of all the visa delays, the sex pistols weren't able to appear on Saturday night live as scheduled.\"","year":null,"extra":{"from":"The Sex Pistols","from_id":6889843679183,"type":"curiosity"},"srcs":[{"source":"The Ongoing History of New Music","episode":"Introducing \"Uncharted\": Sid Vicious and Questions About the Murder of Nancy Spungen","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=LE4YenwmeXM"}]}],"charts":[{"id":null,"type":null,"name":"My Aim Is True","list_id":null,"list":"1001 Albums You Must Hear Before You Die","src":"ensayos","rank":389,"year":1977,"note":null,"yt":null,"scaruffi":null,"url":null},{"id":null,"type":null,"name":"My Aim Is True","list_id":null,"list":"Pitchfork: The 100 Best Albums of the 1970s","src":"ensayos","rank":37,"year":1977,"note":null,"yt":null,"scaruffi":null,"url":"https://beta.musicbrainz.org/series/f2e5e744-d9a7-41f5-bc95-6ee787122bc1"},{"id